OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 11 Nov to Fri 20 NovFAt
OL,6,Fthe start of this period, outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain across the south of the UK will
OL,8,Fclear away as clearer conditions
OL,9,Fspread from the north. A few wintry
OL,10,Fshowers are likely in the far north,
OL,11,Fbut otherwise this will mean a spell
OL,12,Fof fine and dry weather developing for
OL,13,Fmost areas. Over the following weekend
OL,14,Fa change to more changeable weather is
OL,15,Flikely, with Atlantic frontal systems
OL,16,Fbringing rain and some strong winds.
OL,17,FUnsettled or changeable weather will
OL,18,Flikely continue through the following
OL,19,Fweek. After a cold start, temperatures
OL,20,Fwill probably be above average overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
