OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 21 Nov to Sat 5 Dec
OL,6,FChangeable or unsettled conditions are
OL,7,Fexpected through the last part of
OL,8,FNovember. Atlantic frontal system are
OL,9,Flikely to spread across the UK,
OL,10,Fbringing some heavy rain at times and
OL,11,Fa chance of strong winds. Drier,
OL,12,Fbrighter interludes are likely between
OL,13,Fsystems, and it is possible conditions
OL,14,Fcould become drier overall into early
OL,15,FDecember. Temperatures are likely to
OL,16,Fbe above normal overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
